-- PHILIPPIANS - HIN Combined
-- Generated: 2026-01-20T22:27:07.061Z

-- c001-v001: Paulos aur Timotheos, das Khristos Yeshu; sab un pavitr mein Khristos Yeshu un jo–hain mein Filippi, saath adhyakshaon aur sevakon:
-- c001-v002: anugrah tumhe aur shanti, se Parameshwar Pita hamare, aur Prabhu Yeshu Khristos.
-- c001-v003: Main–dhanyavaad–deta–hun us Parameshwar mere par har us yaad tumhari,
-- c001-v004: hamesha mein har praarthna meri ke–liye sab tumhare, saath anand us praarthna karte–hue,
-- c001-v005: par us sangati tumhari mein us susmachar, se us pehle din tak us ab;
-- c001-v006: bharose–wala yahi yahi, ki us jisne–shuru–kiya mein tumme kaam achchha, poora–karega tak din Khristos Yeshu
-- c001-v007: jaisa hai uchit mujhe yah sochna ke–liye sab tumhare, kyonki us rakhna mujhe mein us hriday tumhe; mein dono un bandhanon mere, aur mein us pratiraksha aur pushtikaran ke susmachar, sahbhagi mere, us anugrah sab tumhe hote–hue.
-- c001-v008: gawah kya mera us Parameshwar, kaise main–chahta–hun sab tumhe mein vatsalata Khristos Yeshu.
-- c001-v009: aur yah main–praarthna–karta–hun, taki us prem tumhara, aur–bhi adhik aur adhik badhta–rahe, mein gyaan aur har samajh,
-- c001-v010: ke–liye us parkh tumhari un uttam, taki tum–ho nishkapatwale aur nirdoshwale, ke–liye din Khristos,
-- c001-v011: bhare–hue phal dharmikta, us dwara Yeshu Khristos, ke–liye mahima aur prashansha Parameshwar.
-- c001-v012: Jaanna parantu tumhe, main–chahta–hun, bhaiyo, ki un ke–anusar mere, adhik ke–liye pragati ke susmachar, ho–chuka;
-- c001-v013: isliye un bandhan mere, prakat, mein Khristos, hue mein poore us rakshabhavanme, aur un baki sabme;
-- c001-v014: aur un adhik un bhaiyon, mein Prabhu bharosa–karnewale un bandhanon mere, aur–adhik himmati nidar us vachan [us Parameshwar] bolne.
-- c001-v015: Kuch to, bhi dwara daah aur jhagada, kuch parantu bhi dwara achchhi–ichchha— us Khristos prachaar–karte–hain.
-- c001-v016: un to se prem, jaankar ki ke–liye pratiraksha ke susmachar main–rakha–gaya–hun;
-- c001-v017: un parantu se swarthikta us Khristos ghoshna–karte–hain, nahi shuddh–bhav–se, sochkar kasht uthana un bandhanon mere.
-- c001-v018: kya kya? sirf ki har tarike, chahe bahaane chahe sachchi, Khristos ghoshit–kiya–jaata. aur mein isme main–khush–hota–hun. parantu, bhi main–khush–rahunga.
-- c001-v019: main–jaanta–hun kya ki yah mere niklega ke–liye uddhaar, dwara us tumhari praarthna, aur suplai ke Aatma Yeshu Khristos;
-- c001-v020: ke–anusar us utsuk–pratiksha aur aasha meri, ki mein kisi–baat main–sharminda–nahi–hounga, parantu mein sab nidarta, jaise hamesha, bhi ab, mahaan–kiya–jayega Khristos mein us shareer mere, chahe dwara jeevan chahe dwara mrityu.
-- c001-v021: Mere–liye kya, us jeena Khristos, aur us marna, laabh.
-- c001-v022: agar parantu us jeena mein shareer, yah mere phal kaam. aur kya main–chunuunga? nahi main–jaanta!
-- c001-v023: main–dabav–mein–hun parantu se un dono, us ichchha rakhte–hue ke–liye us chale–jaana, aur saath Khristos hona, bahut kya adhik shreshthattar;
-- c001-v024: us parantu rehna [mein] us shareer, adhik–aavashyak dwara tumhare.
-- c001-v025: aur yah bharosa–karke, main–jaanta–hun ki main–rahunga, aur main–bana–rahunga sab tumhare; ke–liye us tumhari pragati aur anand us vishwas;
-- c001-v026: taki us ghamand tumhara badhe, mein Khristos Yeshu, mein mujhme dwara us meri upasthiti phir ke–pas tumhare.
-- c001-v027: Keval yogya ke susmachar ke Khristos chalo, taki chahe aakar aur dekhkar tumhe, chahe anupasthit, main–sunun un ke–baare–mein tumhare, ki tum–khade–rehte–ho mein ek aatma, ek praan sangharsh–karke, us vishwas ke susmachar;
-- c001-v028: aur nahi darte–hue mein kisi–mein dwara un virodhi, jo hai unke–liye saboot vinaash; tumhare parantu uddhaar, aur yah se Parameshwar;
-- c001-v029: kyonki tumhe daan–kiya–gaya us ke–liye Khristos, nahi keval us mein uspar vishwas–karna, parantu bhi us ke–liye uske kasht–uthana;
-- c001-v030: us wahi sangharsh rakhte–hue, jaisa tumne–dekha mein mujhme, aur ab tum–sunte–ho mein mujhme.
-- c002-v001: Agar koi to protsahan mein Khristos, agar koi dhairas–dena prem, agar koi sangati Aatma, agar koi vatsalata aur daya,
-- c002-v002: poora–karo mere us anand, taki us hi tum–socho, us hi prem rakhte–hue, ekpraan, us ek sochte–hue.
-- c002-v003: kuch–nahi ke–anusar swarthikta na–hi ke–anusar khokhi–mahima, parantu us naamrata, ek–doosre samajhkar badhkar apne–aap,
-- c002-v004: nahi un apne–aap, har–ek dhyaan–dete–hue, parantu bhi un doosron, har–ek.
-- c002-v005: yahi socho mein tumme, jo bhi mein Khristos Yeshu;
-- c002-v006: jo, mein rup Parameshwar hote–hue, nahi lootne–ki–cheez samjha us hona barabar Parameshwar,
-- c002-v007: parantu apne–aap–ko usne–khaali–kiya, rup das lekar, mein samaanta manushyon hokar.
-- c002-v008: aur aakriti paaya–gaya jaise manushya, usne–neecha–kiya apne–aap–ko, hokar aagyakaari tak mrityu, mrityu parantu krus.
-- c002-v009: isliye bhi us Parameshwar use atyuchchit–kiya, aur usne–daan–kiya use us naam us se–uupar har naam,
-- c002-v010: taki mein us naam Yeshu har ghutna jhuke, swargik aur prithviwale aur pataalwale,
-- c002-v011: aur har jeebh bol–uthe ki PRABHU YESHU KHRISTOS, ke–liye mahima Parameshwar Pita.
-- c002-v012: Isliye, priye mere, jaise hamesha tumne–aagya–maani, nahi jaise mein us upasthiti meri keval, parantu ab bahut adhik mein us anupasthiti meri, saath bhay aur kaampna us apna uddhaar kaam–karo.
-- c002-v013: Parameshwar kya hai us jo–kaam–karta–hai mein tumme, bhi us chahna bhi us karna, ke–liye us achchhi–ichchha.
-- c002-v014: sab karo bina kudhkudhane aur tark–vitark,
-- c002-v015: taki tum–ho nirdosh aur nishchhal, bachche Parameshwar, nishkalank beech pidhi tedhe aur bigde, mein jinme tum–dikhte–ho jaise jyoti mein sansar,
-- c002-v016: vachan jeevan thaame–hue, ke–liye ghamand mujhe ke–liye din Khristos, ki nahi ke–liye vyarth maine–dauda, na–hi ke–liye vyarth maine–mehnat–ki.
-- c002-v017: Parantu agar bhi main–undela–jata–hun par us bali aur seva us vishwas tumhare, main–khush–hota–hun aur main–saath–khush–hota–hun sabke tumhare.
-- c002-v018: us parantu hi bhi tum khush–ho, aur saath–khush–ho mujhse.
-- c002-v019: Main–aasha–karta–hun parantu mein Prabhu Yeshu, Timotheos jaldi bhejna tumhe, taki main–bhi hosla–paaun, jaankar un ke–baare–mein tumhare.
-- c002-v020: kisi–ko kya nahi–hai samaan–praan, jo sachchi–tarah un ke–baare–mein tumhare chinta–karega.
-- c002-v021: un sab kya, un apne–aap dhundhte–hain, nahi un Khristos Yeshu.
-- c002-v022: us parantu pramaan uska tum–jaante–ho, ki, jaise pita–ko bachche, saath mere usne–seva–ki, ke–liye us susmachar.
-- c002-v023: Use to to main–aasha–karta–hun bhejna, jab kabhi main–dekh–lun un ke–baare–mein mere, turant.
-- c002-v024: main–bharosa–karta–hun parantu mein Prabhu, ki bhi main jaldi aaunga.
-- c002-v025: aavashyak parantu maine–samjha, Epaphroditos, us bhai aur sahkarmi aur sahsainik mere, tumhare parantu prerit aur sewak us zaroorat meri, bhejna ki–or tumhare,
-- c002-v026: kyonki chaahta–tha wah sab tumhe, (dekhna), aur vyakul isliye–ki tumne–suna ki wah–beemar–tha.
-- c002-v027: aur kya wah–beemar–tha kareeb mrityu, parantu us Parameshwar usne–daya–ki uspar, nahi uspar parantu keval, parantu bhi mujhpar, taki nahi dukh par dukh main–paata.
-- c002-v028: sheeghrata–se to maine–bheja use, taki dekhkar use phir, tum–khush–ho, aur–main kam–dukhiya rahuun.
-- c002-v029: grahan–karo to use mein Prabhu saath sab anand, aur un aise aadarmaniye samjho,
-- c002-v030: kyonki dwara us kaam Khristos, tak mrityu wah–kareeb–aaya, jokhim–mein–daalke us praan, taki poora–kare us tumhari kami, us ki–or meri seva.
-- c003-v001: Us aage, bhaaiyo mere, khush–ho mein Prabhu. un hi likhna tumhe, mujhe to nahi thakaan; tumhare parantu suraksha.
-- c003-v002: Dekho un kutton; dekho un bure karnewalon; dekho us kaat–waalon.
-- c003-v003: hum kya hain us khatna, un Aatma Parameshwar upasana–karnewalon aur ghamand–karnewale mein Khristos Yeshu, aur nahi mein shareer bharosa–karnewalon,
-- c003-v004: balki main rakhte–hue bharosa bhi mein shareer. Agar koi sochta–hai doosra bharosa–karna mein shareer, main adhik:
-- c003-v005: khatna, aathwein–din, se wansh Israel, gotra Binyamin; Ibri se Ibriyon; ke–anusar vyavastha, Pharisi;
-- c003-v006: ke–anusar josh, satane–wala us kalisia; ke–anusar dharmikta us mein vyavastha, hokar nirdosh.
-- c003-v007: Parantu jo the mujhe laabh, yeh maine–maana, ke–karan us Khristos, haani.
-- c003-v008: parantu balki, to kya, bhi main–maanta–hun sab haani hona ke–karan us shreshthttar us gyaan Khristos Yeshu us Prabhu mere, jiske–karan jisko un sab maine–haani–uthayi, aur main–maanta–hun kooda, taki Khristos main–paaun,
-- c003-v009: aur paaya–jaaun mein usme, nahi rakhte–hue meri dharmikta, us se vyavastha, parantu us dwara vishwas Khristos, us se Parameshwar dharmikta, par us vishwas;
-- c003-v010: us jaanna use, aur us shakti us puna–rutthaan uska, aur [us] sangati [un] kashton uske, hokar us mrityu uski;
-- c003-v011: agar kaheen main–pahunch–jaaun mein us puna–rutthaan us se mriton.
-- c003-v012: nahi ki pehle–se maine–paya, ya pehle–se main–siddh–hua; main–peechha–karta–hun parantu, agar bhi main–pakdun, jiske–liye jisko bhi main–pakda–gaya, dwara Khristos Yeshu.
-- c003-v013: bhaaiyo, main apne–aap–ko nahi main–ginta–hun pakde–hue. ek parantu: un to peeche bhoolte–hue, un parantu aage khenchte–hue,
-- c003-v014: ke–anusar lakshya main–peechha–karta–hun ki–or us inaam, us uupar bulaahat ke Parameshwar, mein Khristos Yeshu.
-- c003-v015: Jitne to paripurn yahi hum–sochen; aur agar kuch alag tum–sochte–ho, bhi yah us Parameshwar tumhe prakat–karega.
-- c003-v016: sirf ko jo hum–pahunche, us hi chalo. [niyam us hi socho]
-- c003-v017: Sahanukaranewale mere bano, bhaaiyo, aur dekho un aise chalnewaalon, jaise tumhare–paas–hai namoona hamen.
-- c003-v018: bahut kya chalte–hain, jinhe aksar maine–kaha tumhe, ab parantu bhi rote–hue, main–kahta–hun un dushman ke krus ke Khristos;
-- c003-v019: jinki us ant vinaash, jinka us devi–devta us pet, aur us mahima mein us sharam unki— un un prithvi sochnewale.
-- c003-v020: hamara kya us nagrikta mein swarg hai, se jahan bhi, Uddhaarak, hum–pratiksha–karte–hain Prabhu Yeshu Khristos,
-- c003-v021: jo badal–dega us shareer us neechata hamari, saman–rup us shareer us mahima uski, ke–anusar us shakti ke samarth–hona uske, bhi adhin–karna apne–aap–ko un sab.
-- c004-v001: Isliye, bhaaiyo mere, priye aur chaahewale, anand aur mukut mere, aise khade–raho mein Prabhu, priye.
-- c004-v002: Euodia main–vinti–karta–hun, aur Sintiche main–vinti–karta–hun, us hi sochna mein Prabhu.
-- c004-v003: haan, main–puuchta–hun bhi tujhe, sachche sanghi, madad–kar unhe, jinhone mein us susmachar saath–sangharsh–kiya mujhe; saath bhi Klemes, aur un baaki sahkarmi mere, jinke un naam mein pustak jeevan.
-- c004-v004: Khush–ho mein Prabhu hamesha; phir main–kahunga, khush–ho!
-- c004-v005: us naamrata tumhari jaani–jaaye sab manushyon. us Prabhu kareeb.
-- c004-v006: kuch–nahi chinta–karo, parantu mein sab, us praarthna aur us vinti, saath dhanyavaad, un maangein tumhari bataayi–jaayein ki–or us Parameshwar.
-- c004-v007: aur us shanti ke Parameshwar us badhkar sab samajh, rakhega un hriday tumhare, aur un vichar tumhare, mein Khristos Yeshu.
-- c004-v008: Us aage, bhaaiyo, jitne hain sachche, jitne gauravpurn, jitne dharmik, jitne pavitr, jitne priya, jitne sushobhit; agar koi uttamta, aur agar koi prashansha, yahi socho.
-- c004-v009: jo bhi tumne–seekha, aur tumne–paaya, aur tumne–suna aur tumne–dekha mein mujhme, yahi karo; aur us Parameshwar us shanti hoga saath tumhare.
-- c004-v010: Main–khush–hua parantu mein Prabhu bahut, ki ab kabhie tumne–phir–dekhbhal–ki us ke–liye mere sochna; jiske–liye jisko bhi tum–sochte–the, mauka–nahi–tha parantu.
-- c004-v011: nahi ki ke–anusar kami main–kehta–hun; main kya maine–seekha mein jinme main–hun, santusht hona.
-- c004-v012: main–jaanta–hun bhi neeche–hona, main–jaanta–hun bhi badhkar–hona. mein sab, aur mein sabme, maine–seekha bhi bharpet–hona, bhi bhookhe–rehna, bhi badhkar, bhi ghatna.
-- c004-v013: sab main–samarth–hun, mein us jo–shakti–deta–hai mujhe.
-- c004-v014: phir–bhi achchhi–tarah tumne–kiya, sahbhagi–hokar mere us kasht.
-- c004-v015: jaante–ho parantu bhi tum, Filippiyo, ki mein shuru us susmachar, jab main–nikla se Makedonia, koi–nahi mujhe kalisia sahbhagi–hui ke–liye lekha dene aur lene, agar nahi tum akele.
-- c004-v016: kyonki bhi mein Thesalonika, bhi ek–baar bhi do–baar, ke–liye us zaroorat meri tumne–bheja.
-- c004-v017: nahi ki main–dhundhta–hun us daan, parantu main–dhundhta–hun us phal us badhte–hue ke–liye lekha tumhare.
-- c004-v018: maine–paaya parantu sab aur main–badhta–hun; main–bhara–hua–hun, lekar se Epaphroditos un se tumhare, sugandh meethi, bali swikaar, bhaanevali us Parameshwar.
-- c004-v019: us parantu Parameshwar mere poora–karega sab zaroorat tumhari, ke–anusar us dhan uska, mein mahima mein Khristos Yeshu.
-- c004-v020: us parantu Parameshwar aur Pita hamare us mahima mein un yugon ke yugon. Amen.
-- c004-v021: Namaskaar–karo har pavitr mein Khristos Yeshu. namaskaar–karte–hain tumhe, un saath mere bhaaiyo.
-- c004-v022: namaskaar–karte–hain tumhe, sab un pavitr, khaas–taur–par parantu un se us Kaisar ghar.
-- c004-v023: Us anugrah ke Prabhu Yeshu Khristos saath us aatma tumhare. [Amen].

